# What the Claude Desktop extension leaves out. The server resolves the plugin root from
# server/dist/bundle.js and reads skills/**/references at run time (contracts, prices.tsv,
# check-style.py), so skills/ and server/package.json ("type": "module") stay in. The mcpb
# CLI drops .env* on its own (measured on @anthropic-ai/mcpb, 2026-10-16), so .env.example is
# not in the bundle whatever this file says — the template is README § Environment variables.
